  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">銅傀儡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\"> forge/fabric</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組為您的遊戲添加銅傀儡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">要製作一個，您必須將以下方塊堆疊起來：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1. 切割銅階梯（底部）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">2. 銅塊或切割銅（中間）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">3. 避雷針（頂部）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">每10秒會按一次按鈕。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">它像銅塊一樣會氧化。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">您可以使用蜂蠟塗抹它們。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果附近閃電擊中，將會引向傀儡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若未塗蠟被雷擊則會去氧化。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">使用雞蛋可加速氧化，用斧頭可拋光。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">有時或使用銅錠時會轉頭。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可用銅馴服，距離近時會跟隨。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可用銅錠治療。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">死亡時掉落一些銅錠。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">希望您喜歡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若發現錯誤或有建議，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請在下方留言告知我。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Forge和Fabric版本可在文件標籤中找到。</p>\n<p>Fabric版本目前無配置。<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載我的模組！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>",
